    "We release security updates for the latest version of CaptionMate. Please ensure you're using the most recent version available on the App Store." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir veröffentlichen Sicherheitsupdates für die neueste Version von CaptionMate. Bitte stelle sicher, dass du die aktuellste im App Store verfügbare Version verwendest."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We release security updates for the latest version of CaptionMate. Please ensure you're using the most recent version available on the App Store."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We release security updates for the latest version of CaptionMate. Please ensure you're using the most recent version available on the App Store."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نصدر تحديثات أمان لأحدث إصدار من CaptionMate. يرجى التأكد من استخدام أحدث إصدار متاح على App Store."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Publicamos actualizaciones de seguridad para la versión más reciente de CaptionMate. Asegúrate de usar la versión más reciente disponible en App Store."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nous publions des mises à jour de sécurité pour la dernière version de CaptionMate. Veuillez vérifier que vous utilisez la version la plus récente disponible sur l’App Store."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "हम CaptionMate के नवीनतम संस्करण के लिए सुरक्षा अपडेट जारी करते हैं। कृपया सुनिश्चित करें कि आप App Store पर उपलब्ध सबसे नया संस्करण उपयोग कर रहे हैं।"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CaptionMateの最新バージョン向けにセキュリティアップデートを提供します。App Storeで入手可能な最新バージョンをご利用ください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CaptionMate 최신 버전에 대해 보안 업데이트를 제공합니다. App Store에서 제공되는 최신 버전을 사용 중인지 확인해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lançamos atualizações de segurança para a versão mais recente do CaptionMate. Verifique se você está usando a versão mais recente disponível na App Store."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我们会为 CaptionMate 最新版本发布安全更新。请确保你使用的是 App Store 上可用的最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We use parfume407@gmail.com for our intake and triage. For valid issues we will do coordination and disclosure here on GitHub (including using a GitHub Security Advisory when necessary)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir verwenden parfume407@gmail.com für Eingang und Triage. Bei gültigen Problemen koordinieren und veröffentlichen wir hier auf GitHub, einschließlich GitHub Security Advisory, falls erforderlich."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We use parfume407@gmail.com for our intake and triage. For valid issues we will do coordination and disclosure here on GitHub (including using a GitHub Security Advisory when necessary)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We use parfume407@gmail.com for our intake and triage. For valid issues we will do coordination and disclosure here on GitHub (including using a GitHub Security Advisory when necessary)."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نستخدم parfume407@gmail.com للاستقبال والفرز. بالنسبة للمشكلات الصحيحة، سننسق الإفصاح هنا على GitHub (بما في ذلك استخدام GitHub Security Advisory عند الحاجة)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usamos parfume407@gmail.com para la recepción y clasificación. Para problemas válidos, coordinaremos y divulgaremos aquí en GitHub, incluido el uso de GitHub Security Advisory cuando sea necesario."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nous utilisons parfume407@gmail.com pour la réception et le tri. Pour les problèmes valides, nous coordonnerons et publierons ici sur GitHub, y compris via GitHub Security Advisory si nécessaire."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "हम रिपोर्ट प्राप्त करने और प्राथमिकता तय करने के लिए parfume407@gmail.com का उपयोग करते हैं। मान्य मुद्दों के लिए हम GitHub पर समन्वय और प्रकटीकरण करेंगे, आवश्यक होने पर GitHub Security Advisory सहित।"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "受付とトリアージには parfume407@gmail.com を使用します。有効な問題については、必要に応じてGitHub Security Advisoryを使用し、このGitHub上で調整と公開を行います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "신고 접수와 분류에는 parfume407@gmail.com 을 사용합니다. 유효한 문제는 GitHub에서 조율하고 공개하며, 필요한 경우 GitHub Security Advisory를 사용합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usamos parfume407@gmail.com para recebimento e triagem. Para problemas válidos, faremos coordenação e divulgação aqui no GitHub, incluindo GitHub Security Advisory quando necessário."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我们使用 parfume407@gmail.com 接收并初步处理报告。对于有效问题，我们会在 GitHub 上协调和披露（必要时使用 GitHub Security Advisory）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We will process your report within a day, and respond within a week (although it will depend on the severity of your report)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir bearbeiten deine Meldung innerhalb eines Tages und antworten innerhalb einer Woche, abhängig von der Schwere der Meldung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We will process your report within a day, and respond within a week (although it will depend on the severity of your report)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We will process your report within a day, and respond within a week (although it will depend on the severity of your report)."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سنعالج بلاغك خلال يوم، ونرد خلال أسبوع (وقد يختلف ذلك حسب خطورة البلاغ)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Procesaremos tu informe en un día y responderemos en una semana, aunque dependerá de la gravedad del informe."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nous traiterons votre signalement sous un jour et répondrons sous une semaine, selon la gravité du rapport."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "हम आपकी रिपोर्ट एक दिन के भीतर संसाधित करेंगे और एक सप्ताह के भीतर उत्तर देंगे, हालाँकि यह रिपोर्ट की गंभीरता पर निर्भर करेगा।"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "報告は1日以内に処理し、1週間以内に返信します。ただし、問題の深刻度によって異なる場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "신고는 하루 안에 처리하고 일주일 안에 답변합니다. 단, 심각도에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Processaremos seu relatório em até um dia e responderemos em até uma semana, embora isso dependa da gravidade do relatório."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我们会在一天内处理你的报告，并在一周内回复（具体取决于报告的严重程度）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
